<title>USA: Richmond Fed manufacturing, services indexes mixed.</title>
<headline>Richmond Fed manufacturing, services indexes mixed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Richmond said Tuesday its indexes monitoring manufacturing and service-sector activity were mixed in August.</p>
<p> MANUFACTURING SURVEY     Aug	    July</p>
<p>  Shipments		    16		-7</p>
<p>  New Orders		   15		-1</p>
<p>  Backlog Orders		1		-6</p>
<p>  Number of Employees	 6		 4</p>
<p>  Average workweek	    5		-1</p>
<p>  Prices received	 -0.15	    0.18</p>
<p>  Prices paid		0.17	    0.41</p>
<p> SERVICES SURVEY	    Aug	     July</p>
<p>  Service revenues	   21		24</p>
<p>  Number of Employees	 3		 7</p>
<p>  Service wage		 19		28</p>
<p>  Retail revenues	    11		26</p>
<p>  Retail employees	    4		10</p>
<p>  Retail wage		  28		41</p>
<p>  Shopper traffic	     3		23</p>
</text>
